IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BIZZBUZZ.
*> Author: test-student
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-I        PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.
01 WS-I-DISP   PIC Z9.
01 WS-MOD3     PIC 9.
01 WS-MOD5     PIC 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> BIZZBUZZ: multiples of 3=BIZZ, 5=BUZZ, both=BIZZBUZZ
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 50
        COMPUTE WS-MOD3 = FUNCTION MOD(WS-I, 3)
        COMPUTE WS-MOD5 = FUNCTION MOD(WS-I, 5)
        MOVE WS-I TO WS-I-DISP
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN WS-MOD3 = 0 AND WS-MOD5 = 0
                DISPLAY "BIZZBUZZ"
            WHEN WS-MOD3 = 0
                DISPLAY "BIZZ"
            WHEN WS-MOD5 = 0
                DISPLAY "BUZZ"
            WHEN OTHER
                DISPLAY WS-I-DISP
        END-EVALUATE
    END-PERFORM
    STOP RUN.
